     page starts to feel accidental, so neither exists.

     Hierarchy is carried by fill and ink weight before colour: covered is
     inked, in-progress is hatched, untouched is pencil grey. Spot red is
     reserved for the active tab, the side heads, and a covered stamp.
     ================================================================== */

  /* ---- page frame ----
     The measure is capped so question text stops around 78 characters. The
